@title Crane model in motion at 1920: the bridge of your own crane travels along its rails with a travel drive
@area Simulate
@sizes 1920x1080
# Drive run on the travel fixture, then Hoist in 3D with the synthetic STEP crane and the bridge
# driven by the first travel axis. Holding the high speed moves the girder, the end trucks, their
# wheels and everything on them along the rails; the rails and the supports stay. The Bridge field
# is in metres along the model's own rails.
open qa/fixtures/travel-drive.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate drive run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
click_text "Switch on Live"
wait 20
click_text "Start"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate drive run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Hoist in 3D
wait 4
key Enter
wait 30
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/crane-model/workshop-crane.stp
click_text "Crane model…"
wait 120
expect "workshop-crane.stp"
click_text "none"
wait 10
click_text "=A1+FLD-M1"
wait 10
shot before-travel
mouse_down 371 359
wait 200
shot bridge-moving
mouse_up 371 359
wait 150
shot after-stop
expect "Bridge start"
expect "last stop"
check_layout
